+
+## Request
+Three reports on the order service.
+
+1. Percentage coupon was applied to the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts
+   (12 × €5.00 with 10%: expected €48.60 goods). Fixed in `src/pricing.ts`.
+2. Coupon AUTUMN refused on its last day (30 November): the validity check excluded the last day.
+   README says both days are included. Fixed in `src/coupons.ts`.
+3. VAT on shipping: NOT changed. README states shipping is subject to 22% VAT, shown on its own
+   receipt line; the request contradicts it. Needs a business decision (and a README change) first.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts` (last day, coupon base after volume discount).
